OL,3,GNEWSAMan guilty of murder after wife
OL,4,Afound 'slumped over bed'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been found guilty of
OL,7,Fmurdering his wife after she was found
OL,8,Fslumped over a bed at home, where her
OL,9,Fhusband was present.
OL,11,FPolice were called to the property on
OL,12,Fthe night of 18 April amid concerns for
OL,13,Fthe welfare of two people, and
OL,14,Fdiscovered the body of Tracey Davies.
OL,15,FMichael Davies was arrested at the
OL,16,Fscene.
OL,18,FDavies, 58, from Cefn Cribwr, Bridgend
OL,19,Fpreviously admitted the manslaughter of
OL,20,FTracey, 48,but denied murder on the
OL,21,Fgrounds of diminished responsibility.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
